      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 2.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 2.76,
      "end_seconds": 6.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "yes, have a seat tell me what's going on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.24,
      "end_seconds": 16.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a pearly bump on my nose that bleeds. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.02,
      "end_seconds": 23.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Does anything set it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.7,
      "end_seconds": 35.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "text": "Washing definitely sets it off. A sore that won't heal was there, but it's gone away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.65,
      "end_seconds": 43.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Have you noticed family history of skin cancer or other new lumps?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.18,
      "end_seconds": 48.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Hmm, no, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.68,
      "end_seconds": 52.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Any pain or swollen glands at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.08,
      "end_seconds": 57.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.37,
      "end_seconds": 60.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.81,
      "end_seconds": 63.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.46,
      "end_seconds": 68.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.01,
      "end_seconds": 72.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.96,
      "end_seconds": 93.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.5,
      "end_seconds": 104.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "I've had gout for about ten years now. I've had an underactive thyroid for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.16,
      "end_seconds": 107.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.45,
      "end_seconds": 110.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Thin bones, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.0,
      "end_seconds": 119.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "Alright, an underactive thyroid, that matches what I have here. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.12,
      "end_seconds": 128.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.06,
      "end_seconds": 131.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.35,
      "end_seconds": 136.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.13,
      "end_seconds": 140.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "so, what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.16,
      "end_seconds": 145.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.07,
      "end_seconds": 148.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.19,
      "end_seconds": 155.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.58,
      "end_seconds": 161.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Alright, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.09,
      "end_seconds": 166.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I'm allergic to tramadol, I get feeling very drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.36,
      "end_seconds": 187.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.41,
      "end_seconds": 196.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Febuxostat, 80 milligrams, once a day. It's Eltroxin, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.37,
      "end_seconds": 200.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Okay, and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.98,
      "end_seconds": 211.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "text": "100 micrograms, I think that's what's on the box uh, I'm on alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.41,
      "end_seconds": 215.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "how long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.56,
      "end_seconds": 218.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Six months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.27,
      "end_seconds": 235.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.49,
      "end_seconds": 249.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.5,
      "end_seconds": 270.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 64, BP is 119 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.08,
      "end_seconds": 275.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "shall I start the the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.82,
      "end_seconds": 278.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Okay, nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.48,
      "end_seconds": 302.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "There is a pearly nodule with fine surface vessels and a central dip on the side of the nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.53,
      "end_seconds": 311.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "thank you, you can get dressed i think a dermoscopy makes sense here, for suspicious lesion"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 312.99,
      "end_seconds": 316.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "the earliest is Tuesday, 3:30 pm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.25,
      "end_seconds": 324.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "Please use a high-factor sunscreen and a hat. I'll also refer you to the skin cancer clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.01,
      "end_seconds": 326.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.38,
      "end_seconds": 335.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.46,
      "end_seconds": 338.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "That's fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.25,
      "end_seconds": 343.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.06,
      "end_seconds": 346.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
